  monsterId: 40d6ae073b4148e8844c3c2e926d52e8
  displayName: Spriggan
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d965f22fabf5e114485c95db917ebcc3, type: 3}
  description: Spriggans are small fae, gnarled and root-like, resembling a living
    knot of bark and thorn. They move with a creeping, slow shuffle, as if the forest
    itself is walking. They are entirely silent - no speech, no growls - only the
    faint scrape of wood against stone and the rustle of leaves where none should
    move.
